  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I've added you to **fin-reporting-read**, so you can start on your dashboard.\n\n- **Approvals:** Two approvals were needed: one from your manager's side and one from the group owner.\n  - Nadia Petrov is on leave, so Owen Fischer approved for her as her delegate.\n  - Grace Liu approved as the group owner.\n- **Expiry:** You're a contractor, so the access ends on **15 December 2026**, your contract end date. If your contract is extended, ask us to renew it.\n\nThe change may take a few minutes to show up. If you still can't see the reporting warehouse after that, try signing out and back in. I've marked ticket T-6001 as resolved."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Thanks, that's great! I'll give it a few minutes and then try signing out and back in if I still can't see the warehouse.\n\nOne question: I wasn't sure about the 15 December date. My contract runs until mid-December, so that should be fine, right? And if it gets extended, I'll reach out then."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Yes, that's right. Your HR record shows your contract ending on **15 December 2026**, and your access ends on the same day.\n\nIf your contract is extended, ask your manager or People Ops to update your end date in HR first. Then reach out to us and we'll renew the access to match. The renewal will need the usual approvals again from your manager (or their delegate) and the group owner."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Got it, thanks. I'll check with Owen or People Ops if the contract gets extended, and then reach out to you. Appreciate the help!"
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Sounds good, you're welcome! One small note: Owen only covers for Nadia until 10 November, and she's due back on 24 November. If your contract gets extended, the renewal request will go to whoever is approving for your manager at that point. I'll check that when you get in touch, so you don't need to sort it out yourself.\n\nGood luck with the dashboard!"
  }
